ance of any content supplied by the shape source. You","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"can update a shape source by setting its ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"shape"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"URL"},{"text":" property.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshapesource"}}}